{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94444c56327ff6250188b8c45ebccae6b2e0952fb5375a4c1bd518051f33f65f",
      "text": "音乐剧的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f60a38bf6fc9ac271534f4e7742f74e92f707f7ef75e41cc4a3226f393d8581",
      "text": "给，这是之前说过的毛线兔子玩偶。\n是我送你的礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2edf5a4a104b48514e1fff6cb5949146bc0d309dec35e1d778b8068ddead4f4",
      "text": "我照你的要求在耳朵上系了蝴蝶结哦。\n觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13c748b955b66617cc0121e2e5832c1339e48261320ecdc8cc53ccca0afb1e85",
      "text": "哈哈，不客气。\n你能喜欢真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b37301df3677f0a191f7a3e2a284e6c16334fc30225fcf5b05db791a90e86ce9",
      "text": "……啊，●●●●●●●●●●师父。辛苦了。\n去各处打招呼的工作已经结束了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e4f81925e442ad8dce4d9a84f8b7c826e0ff245e8954990e122eba6264e7080",
      "text": "是的，刚才结束了。从排练的时候\n我就在想了，你跟那个小演员关系真好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73e5b3548ff86c9b0428da41fd30374122207bd7add3cda89af63b18cc93876f",
      "text": "那孩子当时拿着毛线玩偶，\n我就顺势搭了话，事情就是这么开始的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0802f88aaeff3d11292cec1f94d4ec8229dc9860032d3d2286c1738a83bb5dfb",
      "text": "之后我们就聊了很多话题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c59d9724a7e869516d8c8d03ef2daff270730ad471a2dddeb14e482c739a49",
      "text": "呵呵，原来是这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc51d52c69cf71eb7cfb6ef1956e88b2714bb82df001d2676d76d6d8ee404053",
      "text": "马上就要进行走位彩排了，准备好了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ef4d67bab95548250212b903a6a96ec7670a363d93a7959688850c197b8c9fa",
      "text": "好的！能做的事都做好了，\n做完最后的确认就全力迎接正式演出的到来。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
